            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <STMSO1:Refrence>Muscle stiffness and spasms are common MS symptoms, and are often described as &apos;spasticity&apos;. Muscle spasms or stiffness can affect between 40% and 80% of people with MS at some time. For most people, these are occasional symptoms.</STMSO1:Refrence>
        <STMSO1:Synonyme>spasticity</STMSO1:Synonyme>
    </owl:Class>
    


