        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/STMSO#Tremor"/>
        <STMSO1:definition>This type of tremor is generally the greatest when a limb or the whole body is being supported against gravity. For example, a person who has a postural tremor will shake while sitting or standing, but not while lying down.</STMSO1:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


