monitor for side effects, increase dose to therapeutic level
Psychotherapy:
build therapeutic alliance, discuss modality, frequency, goals

Continue treatment
 Monitor for response
Monitor for suicide
Terminate treatment
If in remission at least 12 months
If low risk of recurrence

Terminate treatment
If in remission at least 12 months 
If low risk of recurrence</rdfs:comment>
